OL,3,ACharles sounded 'giddily elated' in
OL,4,Aphone call after Diana's death, her
OL,5,Abrother claims in new book
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new book by Diana's brother Earl
OL,8,FSpencer claims Charles was "giddily
OL,9,Felated" in a phone call to him after
OL,10,Fhis sister's death in 1997
OL,12,FEarl Spencer also says the King, then
OL,13,FPrince Charles, told Diana he was not
OL,14,Fin love with her before they married,
OL,15,Faccording to a "close friend" of hers
OL,17,FIn light of the new claims, Buckingham
OL,18,FPalace is pointing back to yesterday's
OL,19,Ffirm rebuttal in which a spokesman said
OL,20,F"fraternal grief can cloud reason"
